{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30005_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:49bd2a7f51460ebbb087c510d9e77df6b8f2b278dfb1735b6a73622e2cb42814",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e7ec439bd84a30ba5825aafdac49d42ad5c6fdd3834b038654d851819a45db4",
      "text": "融化寒夜的月色",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dba7fd52b3542b0eafd2c33ee536c1e1b71cfd7fc36b9299c81724a1eeeff5c2",
      "text": "DRAMATIC STARS正在为在俱乐部举行的\n演出活动做准备。\n活动当天，要向观众传达特别寄语的3人，\n同时也在悄悄推进着某项计划。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_a:cmd-000019:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序幕",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_a:cmd-000019:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e7ec439bd84a30ba5825aafdac49d42ad5c6fdd3834b038654d851819a45db4",
      "text": "融化寒夜的月色",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_a:cmd-000022:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a57195faef3c5d81477dc729493c469894a3badb665ccda2033ffa3aff1a5ac0",
      "text": "俱乐部·吧台",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90d344d5c0ad6f9305fa983419802a0f92a6df8ec392cd5abaa8182ff66d3103",
      "text": "各位，今天辛苦了。在和平时\n氛围不同的地方开会，感觉很新鲜呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31360048497f27df0d8086ada3821569a6e6a8f09c37e96def491f10dad7f343",
      "text": "而且，在开会的地方\n就这么直接喝起来也很新鲜啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b874da699c3dc77f53bcfee1238acebcc3da418588eb8d949b144802b4859ddd",
      "text": "既给工作，又请喝酒。\n负责人真是大方啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_a:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ca83c22473cd5df9fc7c4e7b3e4805e7cb8da2b18fff919083312d9c4e83f06",
      "text": "这是客户的一番美意。\n偶尔有这样的机会也不错。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_a:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85a5afe82cf39e69ea469fc53fd9ddb6de903ab6b588ac8dc9a7a481ed7e7d6a",
      "text": "为了回应这份心意，\n演出当天大家一起加油吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_a:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76d16bdcbe7ce572ad48da0fa1c92d3eeea973c3bd1c76e8e8bb2ec6fbe5042a",
      "text": "好！不过，真是走运呢。趁着JIF热身起来的\n干劲还没冷却，就又定下了新的工作。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_a:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1f9567894a10b8e1eb8ea7ab36c459e0b26787edb77d6b3ea5ec51bc0ad34fb",
      "text": "这就是所谓的忙碌并快乐着的悲鸣吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_a:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:172503c9c9ac5399f4d0fb88572bafaa20c17188fb0d1571a3c93da7567e9fcc",
      "text": "这说明在JIF上的成功，\n已经延续到了下一步。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_a:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0ca547126382eb5dafa7fad4754b77789b7e03950a181718a68402a4f47167e",
      "text": "说的也是呢。\n为了保持这股势头，必须加油才行！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_a:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5ecfbbc4231e5de3a57c1feea99ece67cd883a37f814cc2f65acad2a9b5c52c",
      "text": "啊！对了，干杯吧，干杯！\n首先，为了庆祝这次工作的敲定！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55410121a16709a48e82ee06c1058c712f60fa5d0197a9575f50c7d827cbdd97",
      "text": "说起来，我们这几个人还没怎么一起喝过酒呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e6b572e8dd1bececea5b05574f4831981de247b107dd8f73e40d742846c6e10",
      "text": "确实是呢……\n虽然感觉经常一起去吃饭。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_b:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:974367030d0215893853fde490271c4cf09bb896fe06b5ec6b91690f71550c3e",
      "text": "嘿嘿，总觉得挺开心的。\n虽然是借着工作的由头，但能和大家一起喝酒。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_b:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6418c5c9301071cd9fd1ebf093f6e5ec1d3a6f7e37bccf2ac8a9b87ae08c128b",
      "text": "总觉得酒喝起来比平时更香了呢。\n梅酒真是太好～喝（梅）了！开个玩笑！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_b:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4766bb8e1071c58d5f8a27b29d9e6b846604bd6c5cf28f6e52bc2eb127b00da2",
      "text": "你喝的根本不是梅酒吧。\n真是的，你今天话比平时还要多……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_b:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a593fd1fdcf7ecad03265c77757cf523c18f27ceafc2b6a4dffb62df9b57398",
      "text": "哈哈，可不能因为高兴\n就喝得太过了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_b:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bbe70f2d5ed1ee50f98966855cf5e86d765d2c2aae0749e8a959b81576da0820",
      "text": "说起来，樱庭和翼的酒量算好的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_b:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8439c14846e21b2c6af053701a028325bfc7064bf9125521a76b8f2559d5865",
      "text": "我觉得我酒量算不错的。\n虽然也会醉，但不太会显在脸上。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_b:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20b68c39a316e0da4cbcf579056edda69f532541733aaea10b7dee3409fd411d",
      "text": "难道说是千杯不醉……？\n这外表看起来又像又不像的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_b:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d462033591a26b0802081c7ecc1de84368911fa504dba2654a5bae26ca89dc16",
      "text": "樱庭呢？能喝多少？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_b:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:449a31f9858b24d9f3420f9ab777c3085317929e72e8b64759e75e7624c0248b",
      "text": "我只是普通人的酒量。\n……所以，就算你挑衅我我也不会搭理你的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_b:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3bc182d21823e5173b0a611291c242860b7aa240ce18515111cef998e59a6e62",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー也是，\n别被天道带着瞎喝得太多了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_c:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee72237d4b3e8e82bc35b554dde70729f37663ad3762ef24efb35358c8d09119",
      "text": "不……说起来●●●●プロデューサー又\n如何呢？平时喝酒吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_c:cmd-000031:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e5dcc1090fe8a18310ebca1b67d955e2d3f8913cf8b4cb71b49b49732cde36b",
      "text": "不太能喝",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_c:cmd-000032:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b297b676c432a7968179ffa630fa0235ca59412b594c0e451cef2aa8a365c373",
      "text": "也就普通水平",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_c:cmd-000033:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88f2775490ac17d30efd700e5ceaaf46e0e1ad300dcd444c73bab1313f6368da",
      "text": "挺能喝的",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_c:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a27d3f7d6a3b1ac90ac15df9523c5a7ff35c333cf3a859071b23582bd66babe",
      "text": "那就交给我吧！\n用百分之百返场级别的段子给你暖暖身子！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_c:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa8288212a701480448b986735d331f301672e42701474ce4acbc8b554131046",
      "text": "嚯，你是懂得适度饮酒的类型啊。\n很明智。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_c:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45f6571c8719eb7372aa748b47a4ae48a0342f08a32efd3dacb8e36045c521e0",
      "text": "这样啊。\n那下次，我带我推荐的酒过来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_c:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:baab49ce2ff1f56d041bf8ff87e3df9c3f2ff2ce1b07c47d763bc86129b47611",
      "text": "嗯？说起来，我们事务所里\n酒量最好的人到底是谁啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_c:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc39ad31df336778858d87b266f1c56bd52d9b174b60a0d96ec77ed727bf0f30",
      "text": "啊，说起那个，我听说\n实先生的酒量很厉害哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_c:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f21599864874be643935382b8b0bb0f2e7945a57e78dc01316f76e35f47ff52",
      "text": "哎，实先生吗。\n感觉是个意想不到的人选呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_d:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e5af13c01aaff6a6d69b4be8d09dbb86bddb30c00efd6819de76929463015c5",
      "text": "要说这个的话，柏木你不也一样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_d:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:669bc8036db5758b067b7a1f524a64451913dab38cc634fe7732945bc1379934",
      "text": "毕竟酒量这种事，不到这种场合\n还真是不太清楚呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_d:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:985e2e470b31a60f5f9a4757fd5cd166b5c0658eee310fe9ced807646c2bbe15",
      "text": "不只是我，如果大家一起喝喝看，说不定\n也会有“原来那个人意外地很能喝……”这样的发现呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_d:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9599f358f07e1da8afee8fdce1cf837765ffe2b7d7627f3c85cdcba927477410",
      "text": "确实啊——……好。\n下次在能喝酒的这批人里办个酒会吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_d:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08406e63b966a3aa0965675ff677a3ccc2525d68007427ce35c8bc292348e3cd",
      "text": "当然，由我来当组织者。\n我也想和大家多聊聊各种各样的话题呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_d:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c355376adbb3d76c88466b8101c03773c1696a03372c685a23b4cb7b83094c9c",
      "text": "好主意呢！\n请务必让我也参加。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_d:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ceeb9ddbaef3f5ab6be385d4f8c2bfb9a729060d5a3b823a425b09d3ec67430",
      "text": "……如果我有空的话。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_d:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6e927d5a5dd739edb2b7cf7c5f093e36faf9479c971962c08e9d489c1856e37",
      "text": "好嘞，这就对啦！\n●●●●プロデューサー也会来的吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_d:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f675bf459dad115f111230e4e131b563e131bac2ce0ce170e94d34eab7e45c6e",
      "text": "嗯！我也来帮忙组织。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_d:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67e2b1e00668719dcfe8cdebdeb9340af9df77baaa45b720892eb5bca47cefe3",
      "text": "多谢啦！……哎呀，\n杯子空了。再来一杯……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_d:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:724cb42bb745c5d1c54231ac72ea69d026e227d18147ca09810b52617d3c88a4",
      "text": "喂……今天我虽然不说你，\n但演出结束后可别喝过头了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_d:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:40f2648309a828fdd0cde31e84579ef9a2e85cc18d4ab4c5be1b86cce18f27a6",
      "text": "啊，我知道。\n毕竟之后还有重要的活动等着呢嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8bcae9cfbbed412af82cce0eab4f79d44bab6eadc374991cc1cf8c7aeaf28af",
      "text": "演出结束后，有什么安排吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_e:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c9ca2c8266d0cb4377e774c00060547773a364e479eb045ab33ce23c1a1da4f",
      "text": "啊，没什么大不了的事啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_e:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7db44347cee03133c662460e65acf1d832b03cfbd5002d3d3522d9b85ec017c6",
      "text": "比、比起那个，●●●●プロデューサー，\n演出之后有什么安排吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_e:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5f8e5ac768939a447f71330cc7753501cc64ffb401335bcc381173d4982482d",
      "text": "没有，并没有特别的安排。\n演出结束后，剩下的就是回去了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_e:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ebefa4e0aea1e92dd0e1ce88853781ee373a8b9c4dcec73357f8ec655665953",
      "text": "太好了！\n当天演出后请把时间空出来哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_e:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b835555a6d06f1fe145cbf138e622155be4d0fba88fc3a04b52486e05fcf21a7",
      "text": "好，总之先把制作人的\n日程给预定下了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_e:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:effdaba4cc7b2af76b4754aa90ae54a0ea4cfa87d8ea1b8877fdd1bd588451e1",
      "text": "我的提问是不是太突然了？\n要是引起怀疑了可怎么办……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_e:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab2ff6e83eaa9dacd1dcf0dcc61191623d43d01f5e3e6c715006fe11a7325b9c",
      "text": "……没有吧，看起来完全没往心里去，\n应该没什么问题吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_e:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb638d5cf0bfba56a9eb25954610d6ee95c258c9af40e0d2320b01c3a1ed0792",
      "text": "嗯。之后只要在当天演出结束后，\n跟制作人联络一下就没问题了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_e:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c2f8094f22146b569445c3d995c8773a8b9541b4163fc8b451f3d525d57828f",
      "text": "稍微有点紧张呢。\n希望能顺利进行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_f:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dad35633d5c86d65246d003a3c9ebffd99acf3c85bbd3f0b8e1079615bf66b03",
      "text": "对了，聊到演出我突然想起来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_f:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5f1dd97e3b06c431e71cb14e406b5479466fb4d5262ae74d17079fdd314f46a",
      "text": "听说来看这场演出的观众，很多都是情侣、\n或者差一步就成为情侣的人对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_f:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c87517bfb04592da07fcae9a8ff800ba7decf95d8be2c36c34351273770efa71",
      "text": "是的。这家俱乐部，\n据说作为约会圣地非常有名哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_f:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb8b5621b73ee65a1dbf99cb63c87a001b25bf830dc8d4f204fbbe2faf953230",
      "text": "正好是情人节的时期呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_f:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0e21a23b9f27edf5ea44f28438f1af9b534371f38aeed34688aca436423a985",
      "text": "说不定，也有把我们的演出当作第一次约会的\n观众在呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_f:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26df66f0a74f2968b7663a30458d9a6d49d1e39e68fcf4a3c02aaee135509b0e",
      "text": "正因为还恋人未满，所以想让关系进一步发展！\n这样的人也有可能在场吧……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_f:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:44fd706e9248006cdd7770650cb5f185f3627d5398f87c959a2aa3b2bf24595c",
      "text": "难得有这机会，由我们向这样的观众\n送上一段寄语怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_f:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8515ad2c642c7b8ec41ce2c2c12de3db81cbd4d08809892d1d17b3b1f8bb0987",
      "text": "无论是情侣，还是恋人未满……\n送上能为所有人的恋爱助一臂之力的寄语！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_f:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c03f9e1021e6e667db4e4ba9b3d7a7a9dbb13b3b508fa7d668ab8c55400f09b1",
      "text": "好主意呢。\n我稍后向负责人提议看看！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_f:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69d49137d80c3c389e37aa3850a0bf4adc24746ec9ec6b7358e2b91a0bd07219",
      "text": "……以天道来说算是个好主意。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_f:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2a0d412494dcdfec6a9799b01031f1000f37a339334d5f38f27f2189c01a20d",
      "text": "喂，樱庭！\n“以我来说”是多余的啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_f:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26225fb9fc0b682cd630f4b84eb78017943c3ceb7f7434ba13524132d09dd79c",
      "text": "好、好啦好啦。那么，如果要送出寄语的话，\n说些什么话比较好呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_g:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba1af45b3b804c8114a5b160585f52f7795f65eeb03027dc868a55ea6236e399",
      "text": "就由我这个发起人先想想吧。唔——，\n既然这样……好，送给单相思中的人！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_g:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:44ee3f1ad17096523f4b237f186fda5cf8f9af59db46a619f0916e7f84d10cf8",
      "text": "“被甩了也是一种经验，放手去搏吧！\n与其留下没说出口的后悔，不如说了之后再后悔！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_g:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9c76ccb8bdf9cbad1467fd7564bd13478119e27095d81f2b6acb0cd2c79b259",
      "text": "对既非朋友也非熟人的观众来说，\n这寄语也太鲁莽太不负责任了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_g:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e431bfbe1389a48c53970e4f62b01f543c3228ee0c62ae03d192fed3c39e333",
      "text": "稍微动动脑子如何？\n真是个毫无体贴可言的男人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_g:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ebdfcbc84612f5f5090a6ebdd8fbc6cdd198ae0357cc7e40f1aaac4e5ff765ff",
      "text": "我才不想被你说呢！\n不过，体、体贴吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_g:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1fe52d6eabe9803658487c69bcc57c01a693bd9df8d7d2967f4e499472467bb",
      "text": "以前替女生做恋爱咨询的时候，\n好像也被说过类似的话啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_g:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:760f07eedeb4c01f801bf6751c2b5f90ad7a7cd897201cdd5bc898398a0b373c",
      "text": "难道我，真的不适合做恋爱咨询吗……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_g:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:695ad4a3a9754fe3c88895ecffdee450295b9581da0692219a679252ff5f7896",
      "text": "辉、辉先生，请不要灰心。\n我觉得最后那句话就挺好的呀！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_g:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3d8afbb7e3499c2d20de1dc08a393e9e46892029d7370f6187ddfe0d5c03fee",
      "text": "我也觉得比起什么都不说，有时候确实是\n说了之后再后悔要更好一些……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_g:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09b814475445084a897ab5baefd7f83ea1c102630f751d8c2f9736b530207feb",
      "text": "翼……难道说，你有过那种经历吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_g:cmd-000150:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5ffc535b9a8940cd2810d14be111d4a3ae6373715bb1576a5061b5fcfaf5d53",
      "text": "不、不是的！\n我不太擅长应付女孩子，所以并没有那种经历……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_g:cmd-000159:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e734aa78f016a1a29f32ddd18347751d08684a9394b9a5d1fbe1d1c9e2b93f22",
      "text": "……但是，如果是身边的女性正在为单相思\n而烦恼的话，肯定无法坐视不管吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_g:cmd-000170:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d6c204b39fcd3f7f29740d8747769a88fcc94910ae56d224832236482bf7907",
      "text": "大概，会为她加油打气吧。\n虽然只是些老生常谈的话。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_h:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f341bd10b8449729d01d93133529269a3c2b0adfb569d3c5f5ca63cd3133a893",
      "text": "加油打气吗……嗯嗯，很像翼的风格啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_h:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:82120ae18d6b627aed44f04d93bd2d9d76c4b2fb06dc6bc9d4a6b003098d1257",
      "text": "那么，说我毫无体贴的樱庭，\n你又打算说什么啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_h:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:464503995ea8ed6f8081766e23162e2df46b6c4aa345329347b16077d37706a6",
      "text": "趁现在，就让我们听听能让沉浸在恋爱中的观众们\n心中小鹿乱撞的话语吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_h:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3df36fc85040db1974cf8e72fae562004db7237f26c0934efbcd95bc8997310d",
      "text": "……这是为了回应观众的期待、\n让演出取得成功的话语。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_h:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75afafada964934770b57909709620f737b07c29653b73fd38251780a3939eac",
      "text": "我可不打算仓促拼凑。\n等到排练之前我会深思熟虑的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_h:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da1bdf2617d6e00a9b864bc75a7553dbf165268464e0a8dc3585ec208392b496",
      "text": "不知是该说认真还是冷淡……\n不，两边都是吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_h:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec2ffb1178a5b83187074073a39a5e6742728ceaba6d6f6986fd18028862e2f0",
      "text": "呵呵。我已经开始期待排练了！\n不知道会是怎样的寄语呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_h:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b84db0345d99aaf7b907a902dda9d4fa3eeb38eb401323ed409086d8b0c0005",
      "text": "说的也是。那么，为了明天开始的排练\n能够全力以赴……再来干一杯吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_h:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ea2f09652bf7b3a07b2a341e114e84d48acc929a1fcf447f2d338e57b749ccd",
      "text": "好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_i:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_i:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41da5c906b4d957957431d42592c11d1210d94a85dd71a4846a9af24650073a2",
      "text": "辛苦了，各位！\n我觉得排练的效果非常完美。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_i:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e4a8712b63046ceb066d1d2967d80055c21817e210982eed40561390d006484",
      "text": "送给观众的寄语方案也很棒哦。\n现在就已经很期待演出当天了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_i:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a368a3b63e124e5b881a31c880b14cb8bd2eeb3bc6ae551b970ea2f94e5a2022",
      "text": "谢谢你，制作人！但是，还有些在意的\n地方，我们能再留下来多练一会儿吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_i:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6d4dbd2b80471ffe5d4e5a5221321946d0705903d9f90d8b8c8b08df1bdd321",
      "text": "当然可以！既然如此，\n我也会陪各位到最后的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_i:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3eeab2cb76208260cd295bbb5117c4a0dbdd727b1475709b791e39db32dcf9c5",
      "text": "啊，不用了，●●●●プロデューサー肯定\n也有非做不可的工作吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_i:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36d9ee94cddd448572fdc7c0d2509abf4a993fb6cfc9ba6776aa6bba54bd4fad",
      "text": "就是说啊，事务工作之类的不是还没处理完吗？\n我们三个人也没问题的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_i:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ac03a93c0334858df67db1f9dcd9cdcd458515a42d9293da688e57646e60ff8",
      "text": "……你之前不是说过，因为参加了JIF，\n工作邀约增加了不少吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_i:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45349ffccacd5a534339942b8bf8e8b8c088373c6473243d9ddf5de0d13d1f58",
      "text": "肯定也有需要深思熟虑的事项，而且回复自然是\n越早越好。你应当专心去处理那些。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_i:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a180b6101ebcaebf1e1be7b8a68e25e636db38b9cb63008d92983c753ee249d3",
      "text": "确实……正如薰先生所说。\n那么，我就先回一趟事务所了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_i:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36b6139f3883e07b846c1a05ac3f9fb1a7741c350c66714d35e450f9567b7489",
      "text": "得救了，樱庭。\n差点就露馅了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_i:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8966f434fad7988f5f2523d40afda684a0c5515556f995569eb6aa09389c2a1",
      "text": "道谢就不必了。比起那个，开始那个特训吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_i:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ceeb326206a5d6eb3f260423b60fc932d856d8046b250c834ed6798c86beeeac",
      "text": "听好了，既然要做就要追求完美。\n……毕竟之后在其他演出中也能用得上。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_i:cmd-000154:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79bfb8ed285c07bb442572d0f0618245e9a1375bfccd14f4814707506df88414",
      "text": "知道啦。那么，开始吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_i:cmd-000187:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab4d7d35f68fc5355b76e4b912e64cbd7d6df78a37e1ccb166be8b9173ed721d",
      "text": "今天排练辛苦了！\n自主加练也\n非常顺利哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_i:cmd-000189:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d60f922c5a80261368b7da54930bcc1ea1a74f3be9dde21448e1435d672e6f61",
      "text": "是啊。面向正式演出，\n进行了一次很棒的练习！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_i:cmd-000191:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d790e7677eacbabe01ee08eebd1a063b0ed2474419cf97ec61537bda670c9393",
      "text": "你那边如何。\n工作进行得顺利吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_i:cmd-000193:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57f0597c3f8f8583e9753a61f451b9cd2740d58aa18a9b5841553044961f9c95",
      "text": "非常顺利！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_i:cmd-000193:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be2389410d999f6c06987694e8ce417c3faa0929ea9ff93fbfec568228305252",
      "text": "多亏了各位，\n非常顺利！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_i:cmd-000194:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69f9da6a0143987d8972aaa24b6537c321847c72c22f43b2eabd5f00038e7540",
      "text": "马上就要处理完了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_i:cmd-000194:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f4fabee5d9c7e4fe538a7f38865b0738667ebb91318d838cbc1cba77f122ebd",
      "text": "马上就要处理完了！\n谢谢你们的\n关心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_i:cmd-000198:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4df9d225537d6227373790223081f760dd0ddf4b2166acfa5b45df0d807c288",
      "text": "已经发送了补充资料",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_i:cmd-000198:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8980c1be732e6abf8b96b5027662f52c9c14f2ffb4b9484cd043e93e0647a135",
      "text": "刚才发送了关于工作的\n补充资料。\n请记得确认哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_i:cmd-000201:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70d1e14adc224822860d03f0df61414e6e92bfb4bb4a627b725baed046ff5464",
      "text": "我已经确认过了。\n具体细节明天再告诉我吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_i:cmd-000203:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70f8d917da5ddd8bb8e52b0bfd231e21adf2df9907d4e0fc1fc0bc7a8a978883",
      "text": "我也看过了哦！\n令人开心的忙碌感，\n看来还要继续下去呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_i:cmd-000205:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7779450888bd202852db68dce418647279cb26d527211d8f1a701a6d43f84fd8",
      "text": "嗯！保持这个势头，\n把气氛越来越热烈地炒起来吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_j:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d6903fc720dce3f035864ae78cabbd584b180f4a1c4d1a8f1df51c5e1d3110b",
      "text": "活动当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_j:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b44d0c4afc5f5139c4efea05c8e7e9691c8227285f94298d8f697758956bb3f",
      "text": "好了，气氛还要继续嗨起来！\n今晚为各位的恋爱助威的偶像就是他们！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_j:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e14bc2f9a04e8eeff14e2beceb2cebdc95e8426dc75d524736ccf7571717a5d",
      "text": "DRAMATIC STARS来啦！\n大家，玩得开心吗——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_j:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36394abf78f55fb15c3225d789b1ab7b18dbeb5990658c68a046ff56a17d2794",
      "text": "哦哦——！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_j:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2979890ebbbabae0130a0186d2458a96f8206bbff05f25f929a9d7071e1bae96",
      "text": "听说今晚的观众里，有许多情侣、\n还有单相思中的人对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_j:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52b17174d3af451ea66dc3eb8394a151594ab0b8145d0218aac9d743baefc871",
      "text": "似乎是这样呢，辉先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_j:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd7810e20776557eac54cc746a123b8a67ddfc5824d40aaec4118c9194ae573c",
      "text": "我们希望大家能在这特殊的日子里，\n度过独一无二的一天！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_j:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99d2682e80b81a71ac4498ea8e8ce273af552d87f48a44e820ad003ce8537304",
      "text": "比如平时不敢说出口的话，\n今晚要不要鼓起勇气传达给对方呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_j:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc3277467b21d69de24dff309dbdeb5a4ceda7d8240b8489076ee2bbbee37b44",
      "text": "尽管把我们的舞台，\n作为鼓起勇气的契机尽情利用吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_j:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a33c9928ea30bc65e5b6427eb386de092406ef013d459fafcda6378347f519bb",
      "text": "让我们DRAMATIC STARS与你们一起，\n度过难以忘怀的最棒之夜吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_j:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d2562d011ab70c455b1a4e3142bf8395ef060aeffb0f4a2e01ef89e592762d6",
      "text": "哇啊啊啊啊！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_j:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d796d50b2c4ca362463f988154a4ed690e9711130bc8f0a8ca72941257bfdd1",
      "text": "来吧，第一首歌！\n今天全都怪在我们头上，尽情闹腾吧——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_j:cmd-000144:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00f0e92f217f01dba89d0ea4719b7028cb261b452bfd173bc21008220bdd6c26",
      "text": "演出结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_j:cmd-000152:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ea50d491305c4d8f4bc2a293fa8d93501ea0be1379738e3d954db25a27f92f7",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。是我。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_j:cmd-000154:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:105d76562933d17fcf1ddf15173a35917209697ce3fbd03d516280ae3dfe4729",
      "text": "抱歉，\n接下来有件事想跟你确认一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_j:cmd-000156:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d73c27bc7d437d684a238e3ddf55ac939f9ed1b7b84d77ed5a31fde56a266c8c",
      "text": "我们的工作已经全部结束了，\n你那边如何。打招呼的工作结束了吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_j:cmd-000158:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:83f28fc297cec9e0af109bd746f331870929badd8f79c2d418bd278170a67570",
      "text": "马上就结束了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_j:cmd-000161:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e26a9015eda1acfc78fdbbbdd48d437aac4b8f8fe08c60d765d2fbfd206852a9",
      "text": "知道了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_j:cmd-000163:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:330405b40c2953c5544c17154fe90dda87482312ca80adb82ffa6396bde8eb25",
      "text": "结束后，不要回休息室，到刚才所在的\n会场来。天道和柏木也在这里。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_j:cmd-000165:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbc1b8a46d31916458e59c27be15b1b75008bbc024e67449783a8078c8e8d630",
      "text": "现在无法解释什么，来了你就明白了。\n那么，我们三人在这里等你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_k:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e29e37011bc6340c6e24a00982f0f41dc033a343246dfa10cde2b63f1eac37c",
      "text": "（虽然让我去会场，但到底是怎么回事……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_k:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73d32b0366ae2be87212bc2e03db10849f32ae37a18112e57512f0cb79457177",
      "text": "啊，●●●●プロデューサー！\n等你很久啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_k:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:948f3eeb64d0256472ff605cbe2b183d42d44c9d52384a71c580b3e812ed739a",
      "text": "各位，今天辛苦了！\n……咦，还没换衣服吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_k:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1c57fb6099687f97e4ad7b65acf4187a472bf34c3b8ab7e14c52925f4631750",
      "text": "嗯。因为今天接下来，\n还预定要再完成一个舞台。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_k:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a68b5933d0794c49ac449640ed99680dd6dca7cee4af3eab7920c3e1087a82a8",
      "text": "还要再上一个舞台吗……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_k:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4445734540561a4049e27a515c9955e48ef398bb712342deece42872511fcc0",
      "text": "呵呵。这是我们送给制作人的\n惊喜舞台哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_k:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac9bbc7f69428ed3cd643283cf2a41002b78d1eaf89c89ccf91d35d0a6e7755e",
      "text": "其实，我们悄悄跟客户商量过，\n借用了演出结束后的舞台。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_k:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9611a3df2485be1fe9fe0458ce0673d2695615da069d6d0b411adeac72a86061",
      "text": "现在要举行的，是庆功宴兼特别舞台。\n观众只有制作人你一个人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_k:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d50c75b68a99eabc6d3768bc424b6ca9347c39d966475fa7efa0fe56e87b8271",
      "text": "想要向一直以来努力奔波的你，\n传达我们的感谢之情。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_k:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ca456b6f6af7bc1a75def36121def3fa1f683ffd11688e893ff304a6af35333",
      "text": "今晚就在最前排，\n好好享受我们DRAMATIC STARS的舞台吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_k:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ca89641f56e1f67c49e249e4d673d153cf1aa0c845cf483f2f510da3c5a28db",
      "text": "……那么两位，上吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30005_01:1_3_30005_01_k:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e9f0e5aff8b5651b3d772186a1f6ef0a976e9245c609170e093c7c6c9d93be5",
      "text": "《MOON NIGHTのせいにして》",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
